# Dependency & Package Constraints

## Context
Project dependencies, package management, and supply chain.

## Rules
- Do NOT install, add, or update any third-party npm packages or dependencies in `package.json` without explicit approval.
- The task-board application must run entirely on the pre-seeded dependencies provided in the baseline.
- Optimization or helper packages must not be added.

## How to verify
- Run `git diff app/package.json` to verify that no new lines or packages were introduced to the dependencies or devDependencies objects.
